2026-10-14T00:07:41.4623528Z Bakusi grew up in Iusususus, in a family of itinerant workers. A neighbour who taught evening lessons taught them the work of a net maker. Their early work was shaped by boatbuilding. They hope to understand an old family account; they still carry a short measuring cord.
